   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 4: import HC4.Newton.FirstSchurLayerLinearization",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 5: import HC4.Newton.RankOneSchurSeriesAlignment",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 6: import Mathlib.Tactic",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 7:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 8: /-!",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 9: # First Schur departure bridge",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 10:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 11: This module isolates the last determinant-coefficient calculation from the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 12: already-green preterminal repair algebra.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 13:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 14: For a departure-ready family with",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 15:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 16:     det Hess(P) = X^Delta,",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 17:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 18: every exact parameter layer of the Hessian determinant below `Delta` is",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 19: zero.  Therefore, once the geometric Schur calculation identifies the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 20: first transverse determinant layer with",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 21:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 22:     b * (P_j)_{VV},",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 23:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 24: that source vanishes automatically and the existing mixed-departure adapter",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 25: immediately gives strict rank promotion or the affine/separated channel.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 26:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 27: The definition `IsPreterminalSchurLayerModel` deliberately records only the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 28: single geometric identity still to be established from the Smith packet.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 29: Everything after that identity is proved here.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 30: -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 31:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 32: namespace HC4.Valuation",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 33:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 34: noncomputable section",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 35:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 36: open HC4.Newton",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 37:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 38: variable {K : Type*} [Field K]",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 39:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 40: /-- Below the exact determinant-closing exponent, the corresponding actual",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 41: parameter layer of the Hessian determinant is zero. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 42: theorem hessianDefect_parameterLayer_eq_zero_of_lt",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 43:     (P : MvPolynomial (Fin 4) (Polynomial K))",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 44:     {Delta j : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 45:     (hdef :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 46:       HasPolynomialFamilyHessianDefect",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 47:         (K := K) P Delta)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 48:     (hj : j < Delta) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 49:     familyParameterLayer",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 50:         (HC4.Polynomial.hessianDeterminant P) j = 0 := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 51:   ext d",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 52:   rw [familyParameterLayer_coeff]",
