   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 63:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 64: /-- The exact local identity expected at a first preterminal Schur",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 65: departure.  The left side is the *actual* `j`th determinant layer; the right",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 66: side is the already formalised rank-one Schur linear source of the actual",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 67: coefficient potential `P_j`.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 68:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 69: Keeping this as a named predicate prevents the final exhaustion proof from",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 70: silently assuming the crucial layer-identification calculation. -/",
   "level": "info"},
