  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 177: /-! -----------------------------------------------------------------------",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 178:   Geometric certificate -> proved Schur model",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 179: ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 180:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 181: /-- Concrete data sufficient to prove the formerly abstract",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 182: `IsPreterminalSchurLayerModel` identity.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 183:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 184: The only frontier-specific field is `determinantLayer`: it says that the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 185: chosen binary Schur determinant really computes the relevant layer of the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 186: full Hessian determinant.  The delicate first-order cancellation inside the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 187: Schur determinant is no longer assumed; it is supplied unconditionally by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 188: `PreterminalSchurDepartureData.determinant_coeff_order_eq_linearSource`. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 189: structure FrontierPreterminalSchurCertificate",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 190:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 191:     (f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 192:       (K := K) D complexity) where",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 193:   schur : PreterminalSchurDepartureData (Fin 4) K",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 194:   order_lt_defect : schur.order < f.defect",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 195:   potential_eq_layer :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 196:     schur.potential =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 197:       familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family schur.order",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 198:   determinantLayer :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 199:     familyParameterLayer",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 200:         (HC4.Polynomial.hessianDeterminant f.lossless.family)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 201:         schur.order =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 202:       schur.determinant.coeff schur.order",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 203:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 204: namespace FrontierPreterminalSchurCertificate",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 205:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 206: /-- A concrete first-Schur certificate proves the exact local model identity",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 207: that was previously an external hypothesis. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 208: theorem isPreterminalSchurLayerModel",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 209:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 210:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 211:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 212:     (c : FrontierPreterminalSchurCertificate f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 213:     IsPreterminalSchurLayerModel",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 214:       f c.schur.order c.schur.leadingScalar c.schur.V := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 215:   unfold IsPreterminalSchurLayerModel",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 216:   calc",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 217:     familyParameterLayer",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 218:         (HC4.Polynomial.hessianDeterminant f.lossless.family)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 219:         c.schur.order =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 220:       c.schur.determinant.coeff c.schur.order :=",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 221:         c.determinantLayer",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 222:     _ =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 223:       preterminalSchurLinearSource",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 224:         c.schur.leadingScalar c.schur.V c.schur.potential :=",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 225:         c.schur.determinant_coeff_order_eq_linearSource",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 226:     _ =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 227:       preterminalSchurLinearSource",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 228:         c.schur.leadingScalar c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 229:         (familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family c.schur.order) := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 230:         rw [c.potential_eq_layer]",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 231:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 232: /-- **Concrete preterminal handoff.**",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 233:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 234: Once the geometric Smith analysis constructs a first-Schur certificate, the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 235: whole preterminal branch is already closed: exact determinant defect kills",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 236: the linear source and the existing mixed-departure theorem gives strict rank",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 237: promotion or the affine/separated channel. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 238: theorem canonicalStrictRepair_or_affineSeparated",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 239:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 240:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 241:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 242:     (c : FrontierPreterminalSchurCertificate f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 243:     (RepairProgress",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 244:         (rankOneRepairState complexity)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 245:         (rankTwoRepairState complexity) ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 246:       binaryDirectionalHessianDet c.schur.U c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 247:           (familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family c.schur.order) =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 248:         -(directionalMixedDerivative c.schur.U c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 249:           (familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family c.schur.order))^2 ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 250:       binaryDirectionalHessianDet c.schur.U c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 251:           (familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family c.schur.order) ≠ 0 ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 252:       (rankTwoRepairState complexity).measure <",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 253:         (rankOneRepairState complexity).measure) ∨",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 254:       IsPreterminalAffineSeparatedChannel c.schur.U c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 255:         (familyParameterLayer f.lossless.family c.schur.order) := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 256:   exact",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 257:     preterminalSchurLayer_canonicalStrictRepair_or_affineSeparated",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 258:       f",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 259:       c.schur.leadingScalar_ne_zero",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 260:       c.schur.U c.schur.V",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 261:       c.order_lt_defect",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 262:       c.isPreterminalSchurLayerModel",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 263:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 264: end FrontierPreterminalSchurCertificate",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 265:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 266: /-! -----------------------------------------------------------------------",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 267:   Denominator-cleared frontier certificate",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 268: ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 269:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 270: /-- A preterminal Schur certificate in the form actually supplied by a",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 271: cleared Schur complement.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 272:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 273: Instead of asking the Schur determinant layer to *equal* the full Hessian",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 274: determinant layer, we retain a full determinant parameter series and the",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 275: exact cleared identity",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 276:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 277:     det(Schur) = factor * fullDet.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 278:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 279: This is the natural polynomial identity produced by denominator-cleared",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 280: Schur complements.  Since the Hessian defect makes every coefficient of",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 281: `fullDet` below closure vanish, multiplication by an arbitrary factor cannot",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 282: create a preterminal coefficient. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 283: structure FrontierClearedPreterminalSchurCertificate",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 284:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 285:     (f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 286:       (K := K) D complexity) where",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
