   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 372: ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 373:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 374: /-- The remaining geometric data in its most economical form.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 375:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 376: The Smith/frontier analysis supplies one polynomial binary Schur series with",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 377: a rank-one constant term, the denominator-cleared determinant identity, and",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 378: the compatibility of the kernel entry with the actual coefficient",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 379: potentials.  Finiteness then chooses the first transverse order",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 380: automatically. -/",
   "level": "info"},
