  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 725: Once the genuine exact cleared Schur series has been constructed, there are",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 726: only two outcomes: the whole preterminal branch is discharged, or a",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 727: nonzero transverse coefficient occurs exactly at determinant closure. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 728: theorem preterminalRepair_or_closing",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 729:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 730:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 731:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 732:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurSeries f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 733:     ((RepairProgress",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 734:         (rankOneRepairState complexity)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 735:         (rankTwoRepairState complexity) ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 736:       binaryDirectionalHessianDet S.U S.V S.firstPotential =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 737:         -(directionalMixedDerivative S.U S.V S.firstPotential)^2 ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 738:       binaryDirectionalHessianDet S.U S.V S.firstPotential ≠ 0 ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 739:       (rankTwoRepairState complexity).measure <",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 740:         (rankOneRepairState complexity).measure) ∨",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 741:       IsPreterminalAffineSeparatedChannel S.U S.V S.firstPotential) ∨",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 742:     (S.firstOrder = f.defect ∧",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 743:       (S.series.offDiag.coeff f.defect ≠ 0 ∨",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 744:        S.series.kernel.coeff f.defect ≠ 0)) := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 745:   rcases S.firstOrder_preterminal_or_closing with hpre | hclose",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 746:   · left",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 747:     exact S.preterminal_canonicalStrictRepair_or_affineSeparated hpre",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 748:   · right",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 749:     exact ⟨hclose, S.closing_transverse_nonzero hclose⟩",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 750:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 751: end FrontierExactRankOneSchurSeries",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 752:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 753:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 754: /-! -----------------------------------------------------------------------",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 755:   Matrix-level exact Schur clock",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 756:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 757: The potential-valued frontier above is convenient when one wants the exact",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 758: mixed-Hessian source.  For global exhaustion, however, the first transverse",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 759: Schur *matrix* already carries enough information to force rank promotion.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 760: At the first positive transverse order `j < defect`, the linearisation gives",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 761:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 762:     coeff_j(det S) = leading * kernel_j.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 763:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 764: The exact determinant clock kills the left side, so `kernel_j = 0`.  Since",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 765: `j` was selected as the first order where `offDiag_j` or `kernel_j` is",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 766: nonzero, necessarily `offDiag_j != 0`.  Thus the preterminal branch is a",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 767: genuine rank promotion before any partial-Legendre potential is reconstructed.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 768:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 769: This is strictly weaker data than `FrontierExactRankOneSchurSeries` and is",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 770: therefore the preferred target of the actual four-block Smith construction.",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 771: ------------------------------------------------------------------------ -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 772:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 773: /-- Exact denominator-cleared rank-one Schur clock with no potential-level",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 774: integrability hypothesis. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 775: structure FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 776:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 777:     (f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 778:       (K := K) D complexity) where",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 779:   series : RankOneSchurSeries (MvPolynomial (Fin 4) K)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 780:   leading_ne_zero : series.leading ≠ 0",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 781:   clearedFactor : Polynomial (MvPolynomial (Fin 4) K)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 782:   clearedFactor_coeff_zero_ne_zero :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 783:     clearedFactor.coeff 0 ≠ 0",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 784:   schurFactor :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 785:     series.determinant =",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 786:       clearedFactor * Polynomial.X ^ f.defect",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 787:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 788: namespace FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 789:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 790: /-- The exact determinant clock forces a genuine positive transverse layer. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 791: theorem hasTransverse",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 792:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 793:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 794:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 795:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 796:     S.series.HasPositiveTransverseLayer := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 797:   exact",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 798:     S.series.hasPositiveTransverseLayer_of_determinant_eq_factor_mul_X_pow",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 799:       S.clearedFactor f.defect S.schurFactor",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 800:       S.clearedFactor_coeff_zero_ne_zero",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 801:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 802: /-- First positive transverse Schur order. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 803: noncomputable def firstOrder",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 804:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 805:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 806:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 807:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f) : ℕ :=",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 808:   S.series.firstPositiveTransverseOrder S.hasTransverse",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 809:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 810: /-- The first transverse order is positive. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 811: theorem firstOrder_pos",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 812:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 813:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 814:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 815:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 816:     0 < S.firstOrder := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 817:   exact S.series.firstPositiveTransverseOrder_pos S.hasTransverse",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 818:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 819: /-- The first transverse order occurs no later than determinant closure. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 820: theorem firstOrder_le_defect",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 821:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 822:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 823:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 824:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 825:     S.firstOrder ≤ f.defect := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 826:   exact",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 827:     S.series.firstPositiveTransverseOrder_le_of_determinant_eq_factor_mul_X_pow",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 828:       S.hasTransverse S.clearedFactor S.schurFactor",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 829:       S.clearedFactor_coeff_zero_ne_zero",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 830:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 831: /-- Package the selected order into the purely matrix-valued first-departure",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 832: linearisation theorem. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 833: noncomputable def firstDeparture",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 834:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 835:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 836:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 837:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 838:     FirstRankOneSchurDeparture (MvPolynomial (Fin 4) K) where",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 839:   order := S.firstOrder",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 840:   leading := S.series.leading",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 841:   active := S.series.active",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 842:   offDiag := S.series.offDiag",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 843:   kernel := S.series.kernel",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 844:   order_pos := S.firstOrder_pos",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 845:   active_coeff_zero := S.series.active_coeff_zero",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 846:   offDiag_lower_zero := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 847:     intro n hn",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 848:     exact S.series.offDiag_coeff_eq_zero_of_lt_first S.hasTransverse hn",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 849:   kernel_lower_zero := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 850:     intro n hn",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 851:     exact S.series.kernel_coeff_eq_zero_of_lt_first S.hasTransverse hn",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 852:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 853: /-- Below determinant closure the exact factorisation kills the selected",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 854: Schur determinant coefficient. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 855: theorem determinant_coeff_firstOrder_eq_zero_of_preterminal",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 856:     {D complexity : ℕ}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 857:     {f : CanonicalSmithDepartureFrontier",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 858:       (K := K) D complexity}",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 859:     (S : FrontierExactRankOneSchurClock f)",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 860:     (hpre : S.firstOrder < f.defect) :",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 861:     S.series.determinant.coeff S.firstOrder = 0 := by",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 862:   rw [S.schurFactor]",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 863:   rw [Polynomial.coeff_mul_X_pow']",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 864:   simp [Nat.not_le_of_lt hpre]",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message": "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 865:",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 866: /-- At a preterminal first transverse order the kernel entry itself must",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 867: vanish.  This uses only the matrix linearisation and the nonzero leading",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
   "HC4/Valuation/FirstSchurDepartureSourceProbe.lean:17:0: 868: rank-one coefficient. -/",
   "level": "info"},
  {"message":
